{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby! It's time for racing! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>OH BABY! KART</strong>, racing like you have never seen before! Innovative drift boost and ultimate abilities! Select your driver, customize your kart and get ready to race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifting Ultimate Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drifting gives you powers, ULTIMATE powers! Speed boost? Rockets? Freezing bams and booms? Pick your style and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect them all? Collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whales, Butters and fast cars! There's karts for everyone! Decorate them with ornaments to show off your achievements or plain &quot;whaat?&quot;, we got chopsticks, umbrellas or even pets for those long rides! The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE MULTIPLAYER ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go against competitors all over the world! Party up or go solo and get that position on the global leaderboards! More into fun play? Setup a custom lobby with your friends! You can show your mastery of the tracks or how you use your ultimates everywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/5cf362cc763c559b7c83d05ebc696a3c.avif?t=1760426386\" width=609 height=153 /></span>We got more! Go on the adventure maps! A fusion of skill-based trials, daring obstacle courses and unique competitive scenarios you can put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Royale Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/fe14876aed27045b3a15f89fda028a77020980eb.jpg"},{"name":"Royale Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/e8209a6d3274794f6134eae72dd9e9323f1636d2.jpg"},{"name":"The Royale Racer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/8be5abce4bcb401be29a0caefd9380369a6945c2.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Prix Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/b16596d7d3af2c65ac9655cda53a8247df5e44bc.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Prix Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/613d1968d546ded8fec9a05f6e96104ea802e182.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Prix Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/69e36b78cc9fbaffa5d978617f8baa1fb7f58764.jpg"},{"name":"A True Partner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/4d8995841cccd3af46fdbae995787a4fc91657af.jpg"},{"name":"Takes two to tango","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/220473ff8dd610dc4e612961f1c64479b4603b99.jpg"},{"name":"We ride together at dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/8f8f74e8406741e882c406734095935774572052.jpg"},{"name":"Adventure Begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2598980/3371194e412785b7fe060b7fe72ea345ef317a97.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2598980?t=1760426386","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760426386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/16d2b9220985140c858dec99cefdec1cdf8d8386/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760426386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/16d2b9220985140c858dec99cefdec1cdf8d8386/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760426386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby! It's time for racing! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>OH BABY! KART</strong>, racing like you have never seen before! Innovative drift boost and ultimate abilities! Select your driver, customize your kart and get ready to race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifting Ultimate Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drifting gives you powers, ULTIMATE powers! Speed boost? Rockets? Freezing bams and booms? Pick your style and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect them all? Collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whales, Butters and fast cars! There's karts for everyone! Decorate them with ornaments to show off your achievements or plain &quot;whaat?&quot;, we got chopsticks, umbrellas or even pets for those long rides! The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE MULTIPLAYER ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go against competitors all over the world! Party up or go solo and get that position on the global leaderboards! More into fun play? Setup a custom lobby with your friends! You can show your mastery of the tracks or how you use your ultimates everywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/5cf362cc763c559b7c83d05ebc696a3c.avif?t=1760426386\" width=609 height=153 /></span>We got more! Go on the adventure maps! A fusion of skill-based trials, daring obstacle courses and unique competitive scenarios you can put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.poster.avif?t=1760426386\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.webm?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.mp4?t=1760426386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby!</strong></p>","developers":["Oh Baby Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adven